  sentences:
  - Ah, welcome, welcome! Thank you so much for deciding to help me fend off the
    toasts!
  - "It\u2019s been hard since the toasts started the plague, but we\u2019ve been
    working together to push them back."
  - "War is hard fought and unpredictable, so we never know when it\u2019ll end,
    but having you around is sure to make things easy!"
  - "Start level one when you're ready and we\u2019ll begin your training."
